    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf Heroes is a fast-paced Roguelite FPS where rogue toys have taken over the House and only YOU can stop them! Assemble your Shelf Hero, wield wacky weapons, and blast enemies into plastic bits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/48a5cd7cea4ac3aef0679ceb209e050e.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/48a5cd7cea4ac3aef0679ceb209e050e.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/786a5d71a6197f0f056c10b47fbfad9a.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/786a5d71a6197f0f056c10b47fbfad9a.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/786a5d71a6197f0f056c10b47fbfad9a.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAPOW! Blast rebellious toys with an arsenal that would make any toy box jealous! A <strong>DIY shotgun</strong>? Locked and Loaded! A <strong>dinosaur-shaped revolver</strong>? You got it! A <strong>frying pan, explosive bow, or a blaster minigun</strong>\u2026 and MORE!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/fd0d5b6a587cf9949518fe66a83917ff.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/fd0d5b6a587cf9949518fe66a83917ff.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ee6a1f47d7f2891f73e259b5dcb55af8.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ee6a1f47d7f2891f73e259b5dcb55af8.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ee6a1f47d7f2891f73e259b5dcb55af8.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own route through <strong>massive open arenas</strong> of the House! Every run brings <strong>new layouts, new challenges, and new secrets</strong> to discover. Watch out for household hazards - that kiddie pool becomes an ocean when you're toy-sized! Return to your Bedroom HQ to unlock upgrades, chat with sock puppet pals, and prep for the next battle.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ca56c6d9d5f3ec0043a361beaf1b1054.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ca56c6d9d5f3ec0043a361beaf1b1054.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ab8921712fccc670e18f5ca98d9992a0.avif?t=1742557965\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each body part\u2014arm, leg, head, and torso\u2014adds <strong>unique perks</strong> to customize your playstyle every run. Combine perks with random power-ups to <strong>discover wild builds</strong> and turn your toy-sized warrior into an unstoppable force!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/b8379833d0ed121d3379131494ba3d72.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/b8379833d0ed121d3379131494ba3d72.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/b8379833d0ed121d3379131494ba3d72.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ac86b5b241e84aa39052bf988732ccc9.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ac86b5b241e84aa39052bf988732ccc9.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ac86b5b241e84aa39052bf988732ccc9.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against rampaging toy Sentinels, Zep Knights, Sharkars, the dreaded dino Ravager, and many other deadly toy threats! Push your skills to the limit: dodge, blast, outmaneuver enemies and take down the toughest bosses to take back the House!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf Heroes is a fast-paced Roguelite FPS where rogue toys have taken over the House and only YOU can stop them! Assemble your Shelf Hero, wield wacky weapons, and blast enemies into plastic bits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/48a5cd7cea4ac3aef0679ceb209e050e.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/48a5cd7cea4ac3aef0679ceb209e050e.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/786a5d71a6197f0f056c10b47fbfad9a.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/786a5d71a6197f0f056c10b47fbfad9a.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/786a5d71a6197f0f056c10b47fbfad9a.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAPOW! Blast rebellious toys with an arsenal that would make any toy box jealous! A <strong>DIY shotgun</strong>? Locked and Loaded! A <strong>dinosaur-shaped revolver</strong>? You got it! A <strong>frying pan, explosive bow, or a blaster minigun</strong>\u2026 and MORE!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/fd0d5b6a587cf9949518fe66a83917ff.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/fd0d5b6a587cf9949518fe66a83917ff.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ee6a1f47d7f2891f73e259b5dcb55af8.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ee6a1f47d7f2891f73e259b5dcb55af8.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ee6a1f47d7f2891f73e259b5dcb55af8.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own route through <strong>massive open arenas</strong> of the House! Every run brings <strong>new layouts, new challenges, and new secrets</strong> to discover. Watch out for household hazards - that kiddie pool becomes an ocean when you're toy-sized! Return to your Bedroom HQ to unlock upgrades, chat with sock puppet pals, and prep for the next battle.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ca56c6d9d5f3ec0043a361beaf1b1054.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ca56c6d9d5f3ec0043a361beaf1b1054.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ab8921712fccc670e18f5ca98d9992a0.avif?t=1742557965\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each body part\u2014arm, leg, head, and torso\u2014adds <strong>unique perks</strong> to customize your playstyle every run. Combine perks with random power-ups to <strong>discover wild builds</strong> and turn your toy-sized warrior into an unstoppable force!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/b8379833d0ed121d3379131494ba3d72.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/b8379833d0ed121d3379131494ba3d72.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/b8379833d0ed121d3379131494ba3d72.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ac86b5b241e84aa39052bf988732ccc9.poster.avif?t=1742557965\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ac86b5b241e84aa39052bf988732ccc9.webm?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ac86b5b241e84aa39052bf988732ccc9.mp4?t=1742557965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against rampaging toy Sentinels, Zep Knights, Sharkars, the dreaded dino Ravager, and many other deadly toy threats! Push your skills to the limit: dodge, blast, outmaneuver enemies and take down the toughest bosses to take back the House!</p>",
    "short_description": "Blast rogue toys with wacky weapons in this fast-paced Roguelite FPS! Mix &amp; match toy parts to assemble your Shelf Hero, discover powerful perk combos, and explore a giant House. Play solo or with friends in 3-player co-op!",
